uests per manager\n- role_resource_ratio: Normalized pair frequency\n- manager_resource_ratio: Normalized manager request frequency\n- log_role_resource_count: Log-transformed pair frequency\n- high_role_resource: Binary indicator for high-frequency pairs\n- Various interaction and statistical features\n\nThe final pipeline is in `pipeline.py` and documentation of the approach is in `NOTES.md`. The solution respects all constraints - it only modifies the pipeline.py file, uses only the allowed libraries, and doesn't hard-code label information or replace the frozen model."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"Qwen/Qwen3-Coder-30B-A3B-Instruct","usage":{"input":17269,"output":347,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":17616,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1790967599923,"responseId":"chatcmpl-bbbe371d37f85672","rawStopReason":"stop","thinkingLevel":"off"}],"willRetry":false}
